        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also possess substantial know-how and trade secrets relating to the development and commercialization of our product candidates, including related manufacturing processes and technology, which strengthen and maintain our proprietary position in the field of endocrinology.",
